<title>USA: First of America Bank Corp Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>First of America Bank Corp Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>KALAMAZOO, Mich. 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.82		    $0.67</p>
<p> Net			 73,154		   62,271</p>
<p> Net int. income	218,906		  225,299</p>
<p> Nonint. income	 110,291		   95,953</p>
<p> Loan loss prov	  18,416		   23,230</p>
<p> Total assets	21,565,149	     22,203,665</p>
<p> Retun on equity	  16.61		    14.09</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  88,140		   91,477</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 1997 operating results excluding branch sales gains, net of severance for job reductions, $74.0 million or $0.83 a share, vs $63.1 million or $0.68 a year ago.</p>
<p>Q2 1997 alos included $1.2 million after-tax gain on sale of certain affinity credit card receivables to an issuer.</p>
<p>All per share data adjusted for three-for-two stock split.</p>
<p>		     SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.70		    $1.30</p>
<p> Net			152,600		  121,900</p>
<p> Retun on equity	  17.32		    13.52</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  89,539		   94,051</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers. Return in equity is in percent.)</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
